{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/60c0238fb0b22cf2fe5ab06c06aaa974.poster.avif?t=1773498199\" width=1138 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/60c0238fb0b22cf2fe5ab06c06aaa974.webm?t=1773498199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/82ade8530525f3d454f4d8d9aa09c43d.avif?t=1773498199\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witness the Dark</strong> is a narrative psychological horror series told in both first and third person. Each episode delivers a new terrifying story, with its own dialogue, routine, and world. Ordinary lives that spiral out of control. Different fates, one purpose: to witness what lies beneath our world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/872834ecc1a97d6babc19d0e8be09955.webp?t=1773498199\" width=600 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/4f8af892ffbfb92e2e28912b65b99a63.webp?t=1773498199\" width=600 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/502cca7e0a5116d9e3e8605cd0d7a3e7.poster.avif?t=1773498199\" width=1138 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/502cca7e0a5116d9e3e8605cd0d7a3e7.webm?t=1773498199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Kate</strong>, a young woman who barely escaped <strong>Mark Tucker</strong>, a serial killer known as <i>The Artist</i>. She survived, but just barely. The FBI placed her under witness protection and gave her a new identity. But Mark swore he\u2019d find her again. And he always keeps his word. <strong><i>Will the FBI catch him before it\u2019s too late?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/79085931863b0a4cdeb886687a204323.webp?t=1773498199\" width=600 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/56cbc1b025010c7207d6877149bda891.webp?t=1773498199\" width=600 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/37a1c30721f9b46c537b6395f92a245d.poster.avif?t=1773498199\" width=1138 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/37a1c30721f9b46c537b6395f92a245d.webm?t=1773498199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stay hidden, Kate takes a night shift job at a rundown burger joint. The boss is a creep. The customers are off. The nights feel endless. The place stinks of grease and something worse. It\u2019s all she has to survive. <strong><i>How long can she keep going before she breaks?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/94e6e2ea0c5ab025cb207fe16d8529be.webp?t=1773498199\" width=600 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/db6eeac4db5d444d89a9eafef48a2983.webp?t=1773498199\" width=600 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/41add3eec2f5aef2e08e2f9e251b37ac.poster.avif?t=1773498199\" width=1138 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/41add3eec2f5aef2e08e2f9e251b37ac.webm?t=1773498199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kate knows she\u2019s fragile. After what she\u2019s been through, paranoia comes easy. But this place hides something. The boss grows stranger every night. The customers make weird requests. Someone might be following her. <strong><i>Can she tell the difference between her fears and what\u2019s real?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/3fbeb1c290b876db1f3a384be58c44f7.webp?t=1773498199\" width=600 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/53b9e7d12cece280be7f7a02f847fb67.webp?t=1773498199\" width=600 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/e144b1cafcdc1bf09a81e0f7e1a912d3.poster.avif?t=1773498199\" width=1138 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/e144b1cafcdc1bf09a81e0f7e1a912d3.webm?t=1773498199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This town feels wrong. People lie. Disappearances pile up. There\u2019s a silence that feels alive. Kate thought she was running from a killer. <strong><i>Maybe she ran straight into something worse. What\u2019s really going on in this place?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/411090?t=1773498199","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/a8ffc3f8a7b97a1f3e2272ae03c8ab33cf5b3a41/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773498199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/2b3fd11cbc0a013b6a2edec3a88bb5cdfe9c7fe6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773498199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/2b3fd11cbc0a013b6a2edec3a88bb5cdfe9c7fe6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773498199","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Bloody Burger features mild stylized violence and psychological horror themes.\r\nThe story explores paranoia, stress, and blurred reality with a darkly satirical tone.\r\nNo sexual content or explicit realistic violence is included."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/60c0238fb0b22cf2fe5ab06c06aaa974.poster.avif?t=1773498199\" width=1138 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/60c0238fb0b22cf2fe5ab06c06aaa974.webm?t=1773498199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/82ade8530525f3d454f4d8d9aa09c43d.avif?t=1773498199\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witness the Dark</strong> is a narrative psychological horror series told in both first and third person. Each episode delivers a new terrifying story, with its own dialogue, routine, and world. Ordinary lives that spiral out of control. Different fates, one purpose: to witness what lies beneath our world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/872834ecc1a97d6babc19d0e8be09955.webp?t=1773498199\" width=600 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/4f8af892ffbfb92e2e28912b65b99a63.webp?t=1773498199\" width=600 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/502cca7e0a5116d9e3e8605cd0d7a3e7.poster.avif?t=1773498199\" width=1138 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/502cca7e0a5116d9e3e8605cd0d7a3e7.webm?t=1773498199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Kate</strong>, a young woman who barely escaped <strong>Mark Tucker</strong>, a serial killer known as <i>The Artist</i>. She survived, but just barely. The FBI placed her under witness protection and gave her a new identity. But Mark swore he\u2019d find her again. And he always keeps his word. <strong><i>Will the FBI catch him before it\u2019s too late?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/79085931863b0a4cdeb886687a204323.webp?t=1773498199\" width=600 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/56cbc1b025010c7207d6877149bda891.webp?t=1773498199\" width=600 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/37a1c30721f9b46c537b6395f92a245d.poster.avif?t=1773498199\" width=1138 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/37a1c30721f9b46c537b6395f92a245d.webm?t=1773498199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stay hidden, Kate takes a night shift job at a rundown burger joint. The boss is a creep. The customers are off. The nights feel endless. The place stinks of grease and something worse. It\u2019s all she has to survive. <strong><i>How long can she keep going before she breaks?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/94e6e2ea0c5ab025cb207fe16d8529be.webp?t=1773498199\" width=600 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411090/extras/db6eeac4db5d444d89a9eafef48a2983.webp?t=1773498199\" width=600 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=